B.M0=new A.ce(B.Mf,["Career and emotions both demand attention. High visibility. Guard mental health.","Ambitious but unstable. Big opportunities, big disruptions. Watch impulsive decisions.","Career and finances both strong. Good for promotions and money.","Lucky period. Career breakthroughs possible. Some detachment from material things.","Hard work required. Authority challenged. Keep ego in check.","Powerful energy. Leadership peaks. Anger and accident risk.","Emotional instability. Deception risk. Guard finances and trust.","Deeply spiritual. Intuition sharp. Emotional sensitivity very high.","Depression risk. Emotional heaviness. Discipline helps navigate.","Emotional aggression. Arguments in relationships. Channel into creative work.","Wisdom tested by confusion. Good for research. Avoid shortcuts.","Strong action with wisdom. Good for leadership and expansion.","HIGH ACCIDENT RISK \u2014 most dangerous combination. Drive carefully, avoid rushing.","Delays, frustration, obstacles. Results come very slowly. Stay patient.","Emotionally unstable, prone to being deceived. Keep finances guarded.","Financial impulsiveness. Easy money thinking leads to losses. Budget strictly.","Excellent for business and relationships. Cash flow and romance both active.","Easy money and luck combination. Financial gains with less effort.","Relationship complications. Attraction without stability. Guard against deception.","Highly unstable spiritually and materially. Avoid major decisions.","Bad luck, delayed results. Financial and personal setbacks. Stay patient.","Relentless hard work, heavy load. Protect health \u2014 heart and BP risk.","HIGH ACCIDENT RISK. Impulsive actions cause physical harm. Slow down.","Immense determination, heavy load. Physical health must be protected."],t.li)
B.M1=new A.ce(B.Mf,["Sun meets Moon \u2014 career and personal life both demand attention. High visibility period. Emotional health needs care.","Sun meets Rahu \u2014 ambitious but unstable. Big opportunities, big disruptions. Watch impulsive decisions.","Sun meets Venus \u2014 career and finances both strong. Good for promotions, relationships, and money.","Sun meets Ketu \u2014 luck is active. Career breakthroughs possible. Some detachment from material things.","Sun meets Saturn \u2014 hard work required. Authority challenged. Defamation risk if ego is unchecked.","Sun meets Mars \u2014 powerful energy. Leadership peaks. Anger and accidents need caution.","Moon meets Rahu \u2014 emotional instability. Deception risk. Guard finances and trust carefully.","Moon meets Ketu \u2014 deeply spiritual period. Intuition sharp. Emotional sensitivity very high.","Moon meets Saturn \u2014 depression risk. Emotional heaviness. Discipline helps navigate this period.","Moon meets Mars \u2014 emotional aggression. Arguments in relationships. Channel energy into creative work.","Jupiter meets Rahu \u2014 wisdom tested by confusion. Good for research and spiritual work. Avoid shortcuts.","Jupiter meets Mars \u2014 strong action with wisdom. Good for leadership, teaching, and expansion.","Rahu meets Mars \u2014 HIGH ACCIDENT RISK. This is the most physically dangerous combination. Drive carefully, avoid rushing, stay grounded.","Rahu meets Saturn \u2014 delays, frustration, and obstacles. Results come very slowly. Do not lose patience.","Rahu meets Moon \u2014 emotionally unstable, prone to being deceived. Keep finances guarded.","Mercury meets Rahu \u2014 financial impulsiveness. Easy money thinking leads to losses. Budget strictly.","Mercury meets Venus \u2014 excellent for business, trade, and relationships. Cash flow and romance both active.","Mercury meets Ketu \u2014 easy money and luck combination. Financial gains with less effort.","Venus meets Rahu \u2014 relationship complications. Attraction without stability. Guard against deception in love.","Ketu meets Rahu \u2014 highly unstable spiritually and materially. Inner confusion. Avoid major decisions.","Ketu meets Saturn \u2014 bad luck delayed results. Financial and personal setbacks likely. Stay patient.","Saturn meets Mars \u2014 relentless hard work, heavy load. Protect health \u2014 heart and blood pressure risk.","Mars meets Rahu \u2014 HIGH ACCIDENT RISK. Impulsive actions cause physical harm. Slow down in all areas.","Mars meets Saturn \u2014 immense determination, heavy load. Physical health must be protected."],t.li)
